### 注册新用户 (如果已经注册过，会提示邮箱已注册，不用管它)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "daniu",
  "email": "daniu@example.com",
  "password": "mysecretpassword123"
}

### 登录并自动保存 Token
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "daniu@example.com",
  "password": "mysecretpassword123"
}

> {%
    // 这是一个 IDEA 魔法脚本：自动从登录结果里提取 Token，并存为一个全局变量
    client.global.set("my_token", response.body.data.token);
    client.log("Token 已经成功自动保存啦！可以去运行下面的接口了！");
%}

### 创建一个日程
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{my_token}}

{
  "title": "面试准备",
  "details": "复习 Node.js 和 MySQL",
  "event_date": "2026-07-03",
  "start_time": "14:00:00",
  "end_time": "16:00:00",
  "colour": "#F2D7D9"
}

### 获取所有日程
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{my_token}}

### 创建一条待办事项
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{my_token}}

{
  "title": "完美整合团队的后端代码！",
  "color": "#F2D7D9",
  "due_date": "2026-08-10"
}

### 创建一个习惯
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/habits
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{my_token}}

{
  "title": "每天写100行代码",
  "color": "#B5C4A0"
}

### 习惯打卡 (给 id 为 1 的习惯打卡)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/habits/1/logs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{my_token}}

{
  "completed_date": "2026-08-08"
}